00:00:19.049 --> 00:00:20.894
- I have heard something about like,

00:00:20.894 --> 00:00:22.346
chugging in colleges?

00:00:22.346 --> 00:00:23.786
- Chug-a-lug, chug-a-lug, yeah,

00:00:23.786 --> 00:00:25.940
chug-chug-chug-chug-a-lug.

00:00:27.152 --> 00:00:28.731
- I may look very sweet and nice,

00:00:28.731 --> 00:00:30.066
but watch out!

00:00:30.066 --> 00:00:32.411
- Sorry you gonna lose, but, you know,

00:00:32.411 --> 00:00:33.526
that's life.

00:00:33.526 --> 00:00:34.466
Somebody has to win.

00:00:34.466 --> 00:00:36.980
But, I always win.

00:00:37.566 --> 00:00:38.889
- So, this is how Flip Cup is played.

00:00:38.889 --> 00:00:40.584
We open our beer,

00:00:40.584 --> 00:00:42.848
and we pour about a
quarter of the cup full.

00:00:42.848 --> 00:00:44.844
Drink our beer.

00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:46.725
Line your cup up, and try and flip it

00:00:46.725 --> 00:00:48.478
onto the opposite side.

00:00:48.478 --> 00:00:49.976
- How you expect us to do that?

00:00:49.976 --> 00:00:53.156
- Once that lands, the
next person in line goes.

00:00:53.156 --> 00:00:55.374
Trash-talking is essential.

00:00:55.374 --> 00:00:57.835
The more they're thinking
about why they suck,

00:00:57.835 --> 00:01:00.237
the worse their flip is gonna be.

00:01:00.237 --> 00:01:00.957
- You suck!

00:01:00.957 --> 00:01:01.897
- Exactly!

00:01:01.897 --> 00:01:03.071
You nailed it, Willow!

00:01:03.071 --> 00:01:05.474
If and when you win,
because you're gonna win,

00:01:05.474 --> 00:01:08.515
make sure you celebrate for a long time.

00:01:08.515 --> 00:01:13.444
(dance music)

00:01:14.993 --> 00:01:17.008
